2. everything-claude-code (ECC)
   https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

What is reused: the GateGuard fact-prompt text described in section 1 reached
EDM through ECC's JavaScript port, so ECC's notice is reproduced alongside
GateGuard's own. Separately, ECC/agents/silent-failure-hunter.md was read for
its five-category taxonomy structure when authoring EDM's L12 lens, and
ECC/skills/continuous-learning-v2/scripts/lib/homunculus-dir.sh for the
three-step absolute-only directory-resolution chain in
bin/_edm-datadir-lib.sh. Those two adoptions are structural -- no text was
copied for either, and that narrower claim is accurate as stated.

